// Page KatieUnconscious Text :
"P1881255613" "<color orange>Katie is unconscious, but alive. When she regains consciousness you fear that she will again be under the sway of the Talons of Vengeance. There must be some way to protect her from their power.</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P97236888" "I cannot thank you enough for all you have done, {HeroName}. So it is with weighted conscience that I ask for your help once more in undoing the villainy of that sorceress, <color red>Serene</color>.<br><br>I have been observing the psychic ebb and flow of First Ward for many days now, and I have discovered, in part, Serene's plan. Unfortunately, most of it has already been accomplished.<br><br>If Serene is to be stopped we will need to undo the damage she has done, regain our footing, and then strike back against her and stop this nightmare from spreading any further.<br><br><color orange>The first step is reactivating the Seer Network...</color>"
// AcceptString :
"P2701357131" "Reactivate the Seer Network?"
// SendOffString :
"P1759130601" "I know, it seems illogical, but trust me. Serene is more powerful now with the Network disabled than if it were reactivated. As long as the Network is deactivated the Seers throughout First Ward are easy prey for the Talons of Vengeance. When the Network is active and they are linked into it, they can rely on one another for mental support and resist the Talons' efforts to corrupt them.<br><br>The Network only failed before because Serene managed to infect the Network with a particularly vicious Apparition. We know to look for them now, so the Network remaining deactivated is only strengthening the ranks of the Talons and further cementing Serene's position.<br><br><color orange>You must move quickly. As we speak the Talons are sweeping across First Ward, hunting down psychics and turning them into more agents of destruction.</color>"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3197053308" "Reactivate the Seer Network"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1460780107" "I know it is not the most just thing to do, but it is one that we can undo. If the Seer Network isn't restored, then every last person in First Ward is going to succumb to the lure of the Talons and sweep us aside in a flood of tears and blood."
// TaskTitle :
"P92910230" "<color deepskyblue>Blood Begets Blood</color>"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P1269652211" "<color deepskyblue>Part One: Rebuilding the Golden Cage</color>"

