"P1621299546" "<t=5 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color Goldenrod><bgcolor Indigo>Listen, {HeroName}, when you get to the Network I'll make certain that it isn't corrupted by the Talons or any apparitions under their sway."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3180866075" "<t=5 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color Goldenrod><bgcolor Indigo>I'm sensing a familiar presence trying to contact you, {HeroName}.<t=3 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=3><scale 1.75><color Goldenrod><bgcolor Indigo>...It's Katie.<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor FireBrick>What? {HeroName}! You plan on reactivating the Seer Network?! How... how could you do that!?<t=4 caption x= 0.4 y=0.4 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor FireBrick>I can't allow you to do this, {HeroName}! I WON'T ALLOW THIS!<t=4 caption x= 0.6 y=0.5 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor FireBrick>If you try to steal from them what little they have left, I'll kill you!<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.5 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor FireBrick>This crime can't be allowed to continue unanswered any longer!<t=4 caption x= 0.4 y=0.4 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor FireBrick>I will make them pay... I will make them all pay!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2385723339" "<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor FireBrick>Nobody in this world is innocent anymore, {HeroName}!<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor FireBrick>Least of all YOU!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2242697525" "<t=4 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color Goldenrod><bgcolor Indigo>I really hate to even suggest this, {HeroName}, but I think Katie will be safer inside the Seer Network for the time being."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2248436885" "<t=4 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color Goldenrod><bgcolor Indigo>Serene is trying to confuse us, {HeroName}. I don't sense the Talons moving in any great numbers against us right now.<t=4 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color Goldenrod><bgcolor Indigo>We need to stay focused on stopping her.<t=4 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color Goldenrod><bgcolor Indigo>I want you to check in with Master Midnight and see if he's discovered anything of use."
