"P3386173230" "<shout>Ahahahahahahaaaaaa!<em>Bitter tears have been shed before, {HeroName}.<em>And bitter tears will continue to fall so long as oathbreakers remain unpunished.<em>A great wrong has been done, {HeroName}.<em>Do you truly wish to stop justice from being passed upon those who have defied the Fates?<em>It could have wider complications than you realize.<em>If you really think enslaving poor Katie Douglas and the others like her will save them...<em>Then why don't you do the same for DeVore and her Carnival of Fools?<em>It certainly would save me the trouble..."
