// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P211044746" "<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color Black><bgcolor Paragon>This is Noble. {HeroName}, I've neutralized basement security. Praetor White is on his way and HQ is on full alert.<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color Black><bgcolor Paragon>Make it quick, over."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P256151462" "<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color Black><bgcolor Paragon>The PPD are responding slower than standard procedure...<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color Black><bgcolor Paragon>I'm going to take the initiative, standby."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3874228781" "<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color Black><bgcolor Paragon>Main power is offline, backups are up.<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color Black><bgcolor Paragon>Normally I would be against this, but given the circumstances I don't think me freeing the prisoners will reflect much worse on me in the eyes of the law."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2944345652" "<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color Black><bgcolor Paragon>PPD T.E.S.T. has responded to our forces in the basement...<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color Black><bgcolor Paragon>They baited me, {HeroName}, now I'm cut off and trapped in the HQ. Stand by."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P469533746" "<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color Black><bgcolor Paragon>They left the armory under light guard. I think I found a way out...<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color Black><bgcolor Paragon>They must have found an old Destroyer ammo dump, there is some serious weight in high explosives here.<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color Black><bgcolor Paragon>Stand by, I don't want to prematurely set off the detonators with comms signals."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3990882896" "<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color Black><bgcolor Paragon>I've rigged the third floor to blow.<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color Black><bgcolor Paragon>Hey, {HeroName}... You do what has to be done. Don't you worry about us...<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color Black><bgcolor Paragon>We'll hold out for as long as we can, you just get the job done."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3460173870" "<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color Black><bgcolor Paragon>I see White... This is going to get interesting...!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P443311065" "<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color Black><bgcolor Paragon>Hey! White! Eat this!<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color Black><bgcolor Paragon>Bring it, bad man. Come and get some...!<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color Black><bgcolor Paragon>You hit like a nine millimeter, White. I thought you were supposed to be tough!<t=2 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=2><scale 1.75><color Black><bgcolor Paragon>Ufff!<t=4 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color SaddleBrown><bgcolor Ivory>I don't know who is on the other end of this thing, but now I know where you are, and I'm coming for you!<t=4 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color SaddleBrown><bgcolor Ivory>You'd better pray someone else kills you before I can get my hands on you. DO YOU HEAR ME!?"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2903929584" "<t=3 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=3><scale 1.75><color Red><bgcolor MidnightBlue>You got the Talisman!<t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color Red><bgcolor MidnightBlue>I just need a few moments to cast the teleportation spell and get you back.<t=3 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=3><scale 1.75><color Red><bgcolor MidnightBlue>Oh no... I was worried about this...<t=3 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=3><scale 1.75><color Red><bgcolor MidnightBlue>You're too deep underground, {HeroName}. My spell can't reach you.<t=3 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=3><scale 1.75><color Red><bgcolor MidnightBlue>You're going to need to get closer to the surface. If you can get to the sub-basement then I'm pretty sure my spell can reach you.<t=3 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=3><scale 1.75><color Red><bgcolor MidnightBlue>You'd better hurry though. Praetor White is on his way!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3076178206" "<t=6 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color Red><bgcolor MidnightBlue>Alright, just hold tight for a few more seconds!<t=3 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=3><scale 1.75><color Red><bgcolor MidnightBlue>Alright, just hold tight for a few more seconds!<t=3 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=3><scale 1.75><color Red><bgcolor MidnightBlue>Gotcha!"

