// Script Variable ACTOR1_NAME :
"P2468570790" "Citizen"
// Script Variable ACTOR1_ACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1282526170" "Get to the door!"
// Script Variable ACTOR2_ACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2931314985" "Please, don't!"
// Script Variable ACTOR5_ACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2021238054" "Look out!"
// Script Variable ACTOR6_ACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P358863278" "What in the world!?"
// Script Variable ACTOR8_ACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P614723631" "Run for your lives!"
// Script Variable ACTOR9_ACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1052833655" "What is going on?"
// Script Variable ACTOR11_ACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1254288344" "Emperor Cole, save us!"
// Script Variable ACTOR13_ACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1858342530" "Run for it!"
// Script Variable ACTOR14_ACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P213622693" "Everyone stay calm, the PPD will handle this!"
// Script Variable ACTOR16_ACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P4258090278" "I'm too young to die!"
// Script Variable ACTOR17_ACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3967825532" "Don't let them hurt me!"
// Script Variable ACTOR19_ACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3297000423" "Help! Help!"
// Script Variable ACTOR20_ACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1886068951" "Get out of my way! Run!"
// Script Variable ACTOR2_ACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P68298005" "What's going on!"
// Script Variable ACTOR4_ACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2295437625" "Don't hurt me!"
// Script Variable ACTOR5_ACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2155319919" "Aiiiieee!"
// Script Variable ACTOR7_ACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P4263672758" "Run!"
// Script Variable ACTOR9_ACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P471968938" "Run! Run!"
// Script Variable ACTOR12_ACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1130954804" "{Hero.gender=male He's|She's} crazy!"
// Script Variable ACTOR13_ACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2889365983" "Nobody panic, the PPD will protect us!"
// Script Variable ACTOR15_ACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3581141547" "Aiiieee!"
// Script Variable ACTOR17_ACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2595533616" "Find the emergency exit!"
// Script Variable ACTOR18_ACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1235289085" "Ahhh!"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P3495107274" "What's going on?"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P313467654" "<t 4><t 2>PPD HQ is under attack?"
// Script Variable ATTACK_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P2599976216" "Hey! Stop!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3571567476" "Now we die..."
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P487072502" "Warrant Officer"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2999408845" "The Tower alarm!<t 2>We're under attack!"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P734757072" "Is there another Resistance attack happening?"
// Script Variable ATTACK_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P4245720948" "Stop that {hero.gender=male guy|woman}!"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P767831065" "Is that the alarm?"
// Script Variable ATTACK_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P2634159871" "Hey!"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P3369364543" "Don't worry, nobody would be stupid enough to assault Cole's Tower."
// Script Variable ATTACK_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P511053194" "...I stand corrected."
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P200272913" "Dominatrix"
// Script Variable BOSS_1STBLOOD_DIALOG :
"P1566973346" "Hit me, {HeroName}. Harder!"
// Script Variable BOSS_75HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P2870657889" "That'll do...<em>Now best you get running... Marauder is on his way, and he won't be nearly as 'helpful' as I am."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P836916166" "Looking for Diabolique's talisman, hmmm, {HeroName}?<t 4>Oh, don't look so hurt, I'm just teasing you a little.<t 4>I could care less what you want to do with this trashy jewelry...<t 4>What I care about is what you can do with me.<t 4>Now, now, don't be having deviant thoughts... I just want to use you for my own gain.<t 4>If you want this little trinket, then I'll give it to you, but in return I want you to make it look like I didn't just hand it over.<t 4>Don't worry about hurting me, I can take a little pain.<t 2>Just make sure it looks good.<t 4>I want Michael to suffer mightily when the Emperor hears that his incompetence allowed his granddaughter to be injured and his property stolen.<t 4>With any luck, Mr. Marauder will get reassigned to somewhere like Lambda Sector, leaving the well-being of the Magisterium to pretty little me."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3343993503" "Mmm, that was very good, {HeroName}.<t 3>I'm impressed.<t 2>As promised, here is the talisman.<t 3>Now, if I were you I'd hurry out of here.<t 4>If Michael catches you then I'm afraid I'm not going to be able to do much to stay his hand.<t 4>After all, I'm just a delicate little girl who needs all these big strong men around to protect me."

