// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1798443826" "You got Diabolique's Talisman from Dominatrix, but at what a cost. Noble Savage and Team Rampage most certainly suffered at the hands of Marauder, and the man came close to crushing you as well if not for Midnight's magic and Dominatrix's questionable methods of manipulating the image of her fellow Praetors. She's a dangerous one, and not to be underestimated.<br><br>Talk to Master Midnight and see what he can do with this damn necklace."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound2_Part5 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1708882634" "Talk to Master Midnight"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P809644885" "Master Midnight will need to study that Talisman and find a way to destroy Diabolique before it is too late."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3820268491" "You got the Talisman and have set Midnight onto the task of breaking the spell over it."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P270680593" "You got the talisman?<br><br>Thank the stars. I was monitoring Noble's mind during the attack and I thought for a moment that there would be no coming back from that, and then Praetor White turned his attention to finding you in the tower. Noble managed to get out of the PPD HQ, but he lost a lot of good men doing it...<br><br>{HeroName}, their sacrifice is worth it, for the good of everyone they gave their lives to put an end to Sorceress Serene's sinister machinations. I just hope that Noble will be able to forgive himself for leading those men to their fate. But for now our attention needs to be focused on stopping Serene. We can grieve when this is all over."
// RandomFameString :
"P2400923286" "I heard Marauder was assigned to Lambda Sector and Praetor Duncan was put in charge of the Magisterium."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - DeVoreDialogTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P1626538229" "The Talons will be here soon, {HeroName}. The Wards must be protected, or the Apparitions will overwhelm us all."
// Answer Text :
"P1957652412" "What do you need me to do?"
// Page Page1 Text :
"P1815070760" "There are four Wards placed around the Chapel. As long as they are intact the Apparitions will not be able to cross the boundaries.<br><br>The Talons of Vengeance, however, are not bound by such mystical laws. They will do everything in their power to undo the magic of the Wards and then the Apparitions will be able to flood in and overwhelm us.<br><br>Stop the Talons at all costs!"
// Answer Text :
"P556134709" "Alright, let's get to work. (Start Mission)"
// Answer Text :
"P2502480738" "I need a moment to get ready. (Leave)"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P623351658" "Serene is aware of our efforts to stop her and has now chosen to make her move. I'm sensing the enraged minds of the Talons of Vengeance surging this way, and just beyond our wards the troubled thoughts of the Apparitions press against our defenses, eager to possess new hosts. But don't worry, the Apparitions aren't a threat... yet.<br><br>If I were Serene, the job of the Talons would be to tear down our wards and then let the Apparitions overwhelm us. <color orange>I need you to help make sure that they do not succeed.</color>"
// AcceptString :
"P331095592" "I'm on it"
// SendOffString :
"P3908612890" "Good. While Makwa and Nadia lead the ritual to keep the wards up, you and I will need to lend our aid wherever the Talons grow most bold in their offensive. Even the Talons have limits, and if they cannot break the wards they will retreat before long.<br><br>The Carnival of Light is weaker than ever right now, {HeroName}, you really are our only hope.<br><br>Good luck, to all of us."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2418565036" "Defend the Chapel of Enduring Light"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3534758953" "If the Talons overrun us here at the Chapel then the rest of First Ward will soon follow. We are the only thing standing in Serene's way now."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P240727214" "<color deepskyblue>Part Three: The Darkest Hour</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3922506831" "The air crackles with magical energy as the wards work overtime keeping the malign essence of the apparitions at bay. A woman's scream rises from the southern edge of the Cemetery, but it is not a scream of pain or terror, it is one of absolute unfettered bloodthirsty rage. The Talons have arrived."
// Script Variable ChatMessage :
"P2276852331" "The Talons are coming!"
// Script Variable ObjectiveUIText :
"P2809698231" "Confront Sorceress Serene!"
