// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2152415187" "Destroy them!"
// Script Variable BOSS_1STBLOOD_DIALOG :
"P1478092279" "...and who is... OW!<t 2>You hit me in the middle of my monologue!<t 0.1>"
// Script Variable BOSS_75HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P92254212" "It appears I have underestimated the strength of your attacks. I will have to redouble my efforts.<t 0.1>"
// Script Variable BOSS_50HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P804918058" "Ok, this is just not fair, this fight is totally unbalanced.<t 2>Minions! To me!<t 0.1>"
// Script Variable BOSS_25HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P4246719953" "Wait, wait, wait... Wait.<t 2>Ok, minions!<t 2>Destroy them!<t 0.1>"
// Script Variable BOSS_DEAD_DIALOG :
"P2393473318" "He who fights and runs away.<t 2>Lives to fight another day!<t 0.1>"
// Script Variable BOSS_KILLEDHERO_DIALOG :
