// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - ScriptDefeatMidnight 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Description :
"P1736416709" "Defeat Master Midnight"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P2063869287" "Blind Makwa"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2468686214" "Maintain your concentration.<t 3>Devore and {HeroName} will protect us."
// Script Variable BOSS_1STBLOOD_DIALOG :
"P2559512963" "I don't need sight to smell the blood that stains your hands."
// Script Variable BOSS_75HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P2079492217" "The wind speaks to me, monster, it tells me where you are."
// Script Variable BOSS_50HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P1212868499" "Revenge is a path that leads nowhere."
// Script Variable BOSS_25HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P663751008" "I'm ready to join the ancesters, are you?"
// Script Variable BOSS_DEAD_DIALOG :
"P1744847917" "Ready as I am, today is not the day of days."
// Script Variable BOSS_KILLEDHERO_DIALOG :
"P3768551369" "<em victory>I hope you find peace with the ancestors."
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P908070003" "Mistress Nadia"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P4157910000" "Look alive now, they be comin'!"
// Script Variable BOSS_1STBLOOD_DIALOG :
"P3766574201" "You cannae win this."
// Script Variable BOSS_75HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P1112329788" "Vengeance cannae last, it always consumes itself."
// Script Variable BOSS_50HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P2975363702" "For me 'der will be a tomorrow, for you 'der is only revenge."
// Script Variable BOSS_25HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P1743106183" "You may drive me off, but da fight is not ovah'!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DEAD_DIALOG :
"P3926907030" "Retreat!"
// Script Variable BOSS_KILLEDHERO_DIALOG :
"P136907560" "<em victory>I do nae find joy in dis victory, but I do find joy in da peace it brings you."
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P1782929655" "Resplendant Mistress"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2742120711" "<t 4><t 4>Don't worry about us, we can handle them.<t 4>Protect the wards!"
// Script Variable BOSS_1STBLOOD_DIALOG :
"P817350161" "I'm sorry it has come to this, sisters."
// Script Variable BOSS_75HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P3136036363" "But I will not go without a fight."
// Script Variable BOSS_50HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P1735516693" "Your darkness can never extinguish the light."
// Script Variable BOSS_25HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P2509244801" "I am but one candle amongst millions."
// Script Variable BOSS_DEAD_DIALOG :
"P2381199834" "I must withdraw!"
// Script Variable BOSS_KILLEDHERO_DIALOG :
"P2752518971" "<em victory>You have my pity, sister."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccessFlashback 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccessNoFlashback 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1518050898" "While you defended the Wards from the Talons of Vengeance, Master Midnight's betrayal ruined all your efforts. Though you drove him off, your victory is due in part to Sorceress Serene's own betrayal of Midnight once she had Diabolique's Talisman delivered to her by that traitor."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3994591358" "I... I'm sorry, {HeroName}...<br><br>My foresight never showed me this, I... I saw Midnight as a hero and yet he was working with Serene this entire time.<br><br>Now all my visions are suspect...<br><br>Or are they?<br><br>Midnight did everything he could to acquire Diabolique's Talisman to give it to Serene not out of vengeance, but out of some misplaced love... Perhaps it is this love that will ultimately lead to Midnight's redemption. I cannot tell for sure, but I know that I will not give up on him."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - MidnightDialogTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page NotTaskOwner Text :
"P472895453" "Let me talk to the Task Owner."
// Page MidnightDone Text :
"P1584432485" "That's all I know of Serene's plan."
// Page TalkToMidnight Text :
"P2143602907" "WAIT!<br><br>Please!<br><br>Don't... Don't kill me. I... I made a mistake, I realize that now.<br><br>I... I bow to your superior power..."
// Answer Text :
"P3734303760" "I'm not going to kill you, Percy."
// Answer Text :
"P646660258" "Give me one good reason I shouldn't end you!"
// Page GoodPage Text :
"P2907332611" "Oh... thank you, thank you!<br><br>I just... I just need a chance to redeem myself."
// Answer Text :
"P3042137629" "You can start by telling me everything you know about Serene's plan."
// Page GoodPage2 Text :
"P2222308454" "Serene said she needed the Talisman to summon the Furies. She told me that she would use the amulet to trap them here in this world so she could control them, and in return for me helping to get the talisman that Diabolique's soul would be freed from the Talisman. Now I understand that she plans to destroy her, the woman I love."
// Answer Text :
"P3290086576" "Percy, there is still a chance to save her, but I need to know where she is."
// Page GoodPage3 Text :
"P4254829600" "Yes... Yes of course!<br><br>The Forbidden Crags are honeycombed with ancient caverns. Serene and Diabolique's old coven, the Ravenwing Cabal, used to conduct ceremonies in one of those caverns.<br><br>It lies at a magical leyline knot where there is great magical power. I can tell you exactly how to get there, but... the place is going to be crawling with the Talons of Vengeance."
// Answer Text :
"P685804423" "I'll worry about the Talons, you think about what you've become."
// Page EvilPage Text :
"P340629148" "I know where Serene is!"
// Answer Text :
"P1860618509" "Keep talking or I'll assume you've got nothing worth saying."
// Page EvilPage2 Text :
"P3843893106" "<color yellow>The Forbidden Crags</color> are honeycombed with ancient caverns. Serene and Diabolique's old coven, <color yellow>the Ravenwing Cabal</color>, used to conduct ceremonies in one of those caverns.<br><br>It lies at a magical leyline knot where there is great magical power. I can tell you exactly how to get there, but... the place is going to be crawling with the Talons of Vengeance."
// Answer Text :
"P4106393545" "You should worry less about them, and more about me."
// Page EvilPage3 Text :
"P2574279215" "<color orange>Master Midnight looks at you with pleading eyes.</color><br><br>Please..."
// Answer Text :
"P243076393" "(Knock him out)"
// Answer Text :
"P2017168695" "I'll worry about the Talons, you'd better leave town before I come back."
// Page KnockOut Text :
"P1103458334" "<color orange>You land a telling blow, shattering Midnight's helmet and knocking him unconscious.</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P2546483014" "And stay down! (Leave)"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3326540209" "Serene's abandonment of Master Midnight has exposed a weakness we can exploit.<br><br>Master Midnight will doubtless wish to visit revenge upon her, but we cannot let him do that, for he would become one with the Talons of Vengeance. <color orange>You need to confront Master Midnight and learn all you can from him about Serene's plan, and what she seeks to do with the Talisman he foolishly gave to her.</color><br><br>No doubt he did so in the hopes that Diabolique would be made his, but surely after making dealings with her he must have some idea of where to find Serene before it is too late. There must be some way to get inside Midnight's Mansion, but with Cerulean dead, his magical portal is no longer at our disposal..."
// AcceptString :
"P2790881794" "Katie could do it."
// SendOffString :
"P3761316984" "Of course! Katie Douglas.<br><br>She has the ability to teleport anywhere she can see. While she has never seen the interior of Midnight's Mansion, you have. Katie can read your mind as you imagine the Mansion and then take you there. Of course, if anything happens to Katie while you are in there you may never be able to find your way out again.<br><br>I'll instruct Katie to aid you through the <color yellow>Seer Network</color>.<br><br>I'm afraid that now, more than ever, her mind must remain safely inside that damndable prison. Any animosity she has toward you when this is all over I ensure will instead be directed toward me."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P859247706" "Serene has made a critical error in betraying Midnight. With his assistance we can stop Serene before it's too late.<br><br>Katie Douglas will be the key in getting inside Midnight's Mansion."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P1640072976" "<color deepskyblue>Part 4: Darkest Before the Dawn</color>"

