"P1059169836" "Shambling Archmage"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2351644674" "To the master!"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1540671524" "<shout>You DARE defile my inner sanctum with your muddy shoes and obsession with PUNCHING!?"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P4079550193" "Midnight Masters... Master Midnight commands you to destroy the intruders!"
// Script Variable BOSS_1STBLOOD_DIALOG :
"P2108545832" "Where as before I was only using a shadow of my eldritch mastery, now I shall show you the majesty of my matchless mystical might!<t 0.1>"
// Script Variable BOSS_75HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P3658196302" "Now face my full POWER!<t 3>MINIONS! TO ME!<t 0.1>"
// Script Variable BOSS_50HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P983494357" "No... Wait, that's the wrong power stone. Hold on...<t 0.1>"
// Script Variable BOSS_25HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P3558528036" "Ah! My shielding sphere! You shattered it!<t 0.1>"
// Script Variable BOSS_DEAD_DIALOG :
"P194628438" "Wait... Wait.<t 2>I... I can help you...<t 3>To stop Serene.<t 0.1>"
// Script Variable BOSS_KILLEDHERO_DIALOG :
"P1898649694" "<em victory>Morons! My maverick magical mastery mysteriously makes most mystic mages mirror mere minions!<t 2>Sweet, nailed it!<t 0.1>"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1751433275" "WAIT!<t 2>Please!<t 2>Don't... Don't kill me. I... I made a mistake, I realize that now.<t 4>I... I bow to your superior power...<t 0.1>"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3994062241" "Oh... thank you, thank you!<t 3>I just... I just need a chance to redeem myself.<t 4>Serene said she needed the Talisman to summon the Furies.<t 4>She told me that she would use the amulet to trap them here in this world so she could control them.<t 4>And in return for me helping to get the talisman that Diabolique's soul would be freed from the Talisman.<t 4>Now I understand that she plans to destroy her, the woman I love.<t 0.1>"
// Script Variable SaysList :
